1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,610
For twenty years,

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:04,635
a dead man kept a diary about me.

3
00:00:04,785 --> 00:00:08,143
The torch was still on when I reached the lamp post.

4
00:00:08,193 --> 00:00:09,183
No one there.

5
00:00:09,233 --> 00:00:10,908
Just Mick's old torch,

6
00:00:10,958 --> 00:00:12,286
tied to the post.

7
00:00:12,336 --> 00:00:14,120
Pointed at my window.

8
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,045
And under it,

9
00:00:15,095 --> 00:00:16,290
a key.

10
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,925
Back door.

11
00:00:18,235 --> 00:00:21,153
Mick's house smelt of wolfsbane.

12
00:00:21,203 --> 00:00:22,848
Twenty notebooks on the shelf.

13
00:00:22,898 --> 00:00:24,769
One for every year.

14
00:00:24,819 --> 00:00:26,554
Every full moon,

15
00:00:26,604 --> 00:00:28,268
the same line.

16
00:00:28,318 --> 00:00:29,388
My initial.

17
00:00:29,438 --> 00:00:30,753
At the window.

18
00:00:30,803 --> 00:00:31,830
Held.

19
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,331
I found the summer we were ten.

20
00:00:34,381 --> 00:00:36,492
The night I went missing.

21
00:00:36,562 --> 00:00:38,417
He'd written it one-handed.

22
00:00:38,887 --> 00:00:40,524
It wasn't my initial.

23
00:00:40,674 --> 00:00:42,039
It was Danny's.

24
00:00:42,669 --> 00:00:44,955
Danny told me it was me.

25
00:00:45,185 --> 00:00:46,820
There was one more page.

26
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:48,934
The night Mick died.

27
00:00:49,004 --> 00:00:50,074
If I go,

28
00:00:50,124 --> 00:00:52,134
keep Danny away from the boy.

29
00:00:52,604 --> 00:00:54,706
Mick wasn't keeping me in.

30
00:00:54,816 --> 00:00:56,851
He was keeping Danny out.

31
00:00:59,961 --> 00:01:01,201
He has a key.
